<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Mpoto Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Bhaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa jaka Paulo kwa Bhaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bhaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bhae</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa jaka Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bhaefeso</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa kwa Bhaefeso jakalembakiki mu chikahi chimu na baluwa kwa Bhakolosai mu chaka cha 60 baada ja kubhelakeka Yesu Kristo. Mlemba akaliloghwili mweni kubha nde Mtumi Paulo (Sula 1:1). Bhasomi bhamaheli bhajetakela kubha Paulo akalembiki baluwa ja Bhaefeso, hata ngati baluwa heji ngachejibhi na ulamukilu waki mweni ngati makubheli kwa baluwa kwa Bhakolosai. Kwa ndandi hajeji, iwezikana akapaliki jiyongalutaje pachilanda ja makanisa ghaghakabhili mu mkoa ghonihoghu. Kabhete, Paulo alanda kubha akabhi muligeleza chikahi paakabhi alemba baluwa heji (Sula 3:1, 4:1 na 6:20). Paulo akatumiki baluwa heji kwa chiwoku chaka Tikiko joakabhi na mwanja wa kulijendela likanisa la ku muchi wa ku Efeso (Sula 6:1-7).</para>
  <para style="ip">Efeso ukabhi muchi ukolongwa wa utawala wa dola ja Kiloma mu Asia Njoko. Efeso ukabhi muchi ghoumanyikana nakanopi kwa kubha na nyumba jaka kichapanga jejachengakiki monihomu na kubhohakeka kwaka kichapanga mbomba wa Kigiliki joakalowakiki Artemi (Matendu 19:23-31). Likanisa la ku Efeso lakatumbwili kwa makili nambu palongi likatehi kulilibhalila (Uyekuliku 2:1-7).</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo alanda mu nusu ja kutumbula ja baluwa jenu ntundu Chapanga moabhahaghuli bhandu bha kubhakengalela kuhuma mu mahoku ghabhu kwa indela jaka Yesu Kristo. Alilenganesha likanisa na hyegha, na Kristo ngati mmutu waki, kabhete alilenganesha likanisa na lichengu, na Kristo ngati liganga la luhuli au liganga la kunkeghe la kukamulakila lichengu heli. Mu nusu ja baluwa jenu, Paulo abhapwaghila bhandu bhokapi ntundu moibhapalakila kutama kwa matamu gha Kikristo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaghabhihomu</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo aliloghola na kubhalamukila Bhaefeso, (Sula 1:1-2).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabhete alongalela likanisa molitamila papamu na Kristo (Sula 1:3-3:21).</para>
  <para style="io">Kubhokela panihapa Paulo alemba ntundu moibhapalakila Bhakristo kutama (Sula 4:1-6:20).</para>
  <para style="io">Na ujomukelu Paulo abhoha malobhi gha kujomulela (Sula 6:21-24).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Nepani Paulo, mtumi waka Yesu Kristo kwa mapalu ghaka Chapanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Nundembela mwehapa bhandu bhaka Chapanga mwembi ku Efeso huko, mwembi bhalongwana mu kulombana na Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Chihomu na chibya kwinu, na lukwali yeihuma kwaka Chapanga Atati witu, na kwaka Bambo Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhupu ya kiroho muka Kristo Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Alumbalikaje Chapanga na Atati waka Bambo witu Yesu Kristo! Joatupengalili tepani kwa mbengalelu yokapi ya kiroho, mu ndema wa roho mkati jaka Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Mangani ja kubhombakeka kwa ndema, Chapanga akatuhawili tubya bhaki mu kulombana na Kristo nahuli tubya bhahuhu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">bhandu bhangakubha na mahakau palongi jaki mu upalu wake. <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Kwa ndandi Chapanga akalongulili kutuhaghula tukubha bhana bhaki kwa indela jaka Yesu Kristo, kulengana na mapalu ghaki mwene. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Bhela, alumbalikaje Chapanga kwa chiha chaki chikolongwa cheatujeghalili tepani muka Mwana waki mpalu! <verse eid="EPH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Maghambu kwa mwahi waki Kristo tepani tukombuliwi, yani mahoku ghitu ghabhohakeka. Nde moubhelili ukolongwa wa chihomu chaki. <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>Na jombi akatujonjakili jeniheji kwa umaheli!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Kwa mbulau yokapi na umanyi wokapi. <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Chapanga akatendiki chela cheakapaliki, akatumanyihi mpangu waki ghouhiyakiki, ambau akabhi aholalili kuuhenga kwa indela jaka Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Nahuli chipata kupitalila chikahi chela cha ukamilifu, yani kuibheka hindu yokapi ya kunani kumahunde na hindu ya pandepa, pahi jaka chiongozi jumu, yani Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Mu kulombana na Kristo tepani natatu tupatiki upwelelu wa ukengaleku koni tukahaghulika kutumbula kubhombakeka kwa ndema, kwa ndandi Chapanga mweni nde joatendiki mambu ghokapi kubhokana na mapalu ghaki. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Bhela, tepani tetulongulili kunhobhalela Kristo itupalika kubha sifa ja ulumbalilu waka Chapanga!<verse eid="EPH 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Mwehapa nanamu mkajingili muka Kristo pamukajowini ubholu wa chakaka, yani Malobhi Manyahi gha ukengaleku winu. Kabhete njomwili kunhobhalela Kristo, najombi Chapanga anjeghili mwehapa muhuli wa Roho Mhuhu panani jinu ambaju akatulaghili nahuli kulangiha kubha mwehapa nde bhandu bhaki. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Roho hoju nde poni ja upwelelu witu, nahuli kuleta ukombola wa bhandu bhaka Chapanga kwa sifa ja ulumbalilu waki!<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malobhu ghaka Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Kwa ndandi jeniheji, kutumbu panajowini panani ja uhobhalelu winu muka Bambo Yesu, na upalu winu kwa bhandu bhokapi bhaka Chapanga, <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>ngachengotwiki ng'o kunchengu Chapanga kwa ndandi jinu. Nunkomboka mu malobhu ghangu, <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>nahuli Chapanga waka Bambo witu Yesu Kristo, Atati wa ulumbalilu, ampekya mwehapa Roho wa mbulau na ja uyekuliku mu kummanya Chapanga nakanopi. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Nundobha Chapanga ahoghula mihu gha mitima jinu nahuli mpata kuubhona unang'anu waki, mpata kumanya lihobhalelu lela leandokile na umaheli wa hindu yaki na ulumbalilu ukolongwa wa nhupu wa upwelelu ghoabhabhekili bhandu bhaki, <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>na mpata kumanya ntundu uwezu waki moubheli ukolongwa nakanopi kwa ndandi jitu tepani tetuhobhalela. Uwezu hoghu ghouhenga lihengu mkati jitu na ulengana na makili ghala makolongwa nakanopi, <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>ambaghu akaghatumili paakamuhyohiki Kristo kuhuma kwa bhabhapotili, na kuntamika ku chiwoku chaki cha kumalelelu kunani kumahunde. <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>Konihoku, Kristo abhi na makili panani ja bhatawala bhokapi bha kunani kumahunde, lujiniku, na makili, na manduna, na lihina laki nde likolongwa kupeta cheo chokapi chechiweza kuloghuleka mu ndema ghoni na mu ndema ghouhika. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Chapanga abhekiki hindu yokapi pahi ja magholu ghaka Kristo, ambekiki abya chiongozi wa hindu yokapi kwa ndandi ja likanisa. <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>Likanisa heli nde hyegha jaka Kristo, na nde ukamilifu waki jombi joalenganakela hindu yokapi kila pandu.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kuhuma mu Kupotela mbaka Womi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Na mwehapa mkabhi ngati mwempotili kwa ndandi ja mahakau na mahoku ghinu. <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Chikahi chela mkatami kwa kujengalela ntundu uhakau wa ndema ghoni, mkabhi muntii mtawala wa majobhi ghana makili gha munani, roho ambayu ibhatawala sajenu bhandu bhangakuntii Chapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Tepani tabhokapi bhelabhela tukatemi pachilanda jabhu pamwandi hapa, tukahengaje utokulelu wa mitetu jitu ja mahoku na kujengalela utokulelu waki na maholalelu ghaki. Na tepani kwa utumbulilu tukabhi bhana bha inyela, ngati mundu jongi jokapi.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Nambu Chapanga nde joabhi na chiha chamaheli, akatupaliki kwa upalu wangakupemeka, <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>hata patakabhi tupotili kiroho kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghitu, akatutendiki kubha bhomi papamu na Kristo Yesu. Kwa chihomu chaka Chapanga mwehapa mkengaliwi. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Kwa kulombana na Kristo Yesu, Chapanga akatuyohiki papamu najombi tukatawalaje mu ndema wa kiroho. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Akahengiki bhenibhela nahuli mu ikahi yela yeihika apata kulangiha wamaheli wa chihomu chaki changakupemeka, yeyakalangahiki kwitu kwa wambone waki mkati jaka Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Maghambu kwa chihomu chaka Chapanga mkengaliwi kwa indela ja uhobhalelu, ambayu yeniheyi ngacheibhokana na mwehapa mwabhete. Nambu nde nhupu kuhuma kwaka Chapanga, <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>wala nga kwa matendu, nahuli mundu jokapi jola ngayihika kulilumbalila. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Maghambu tepani nde lihengu la mabhoku ghaka Chapanga, tubhombakiki bhahenu kwa kulombana na Kristo Yesu, nahuli tupata kutenda matendu ghambone, ambaghu Chapanga akalongulili kughalenganakela nahuli tupata kutama mu ghanihagha.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhamu muka Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Kwa ndandi ja ghanihagha nkombukaje kubha mwehapa mwandi mkabhi bhandu bha mataifa ghangi kwa kubhelakeka na kulohakeka, “Bhangakuheketa jando,” na Bhayahude bhabhaliloha, “Bhabhahekiti jando,” yani jando yeihengakeka kwa mabhoku gha bhandu. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Mkombukaje chikahi chela ngachemkabhi na Kristo, mkabhi kunja ja bhandu bhaka Chapanga, yani Izilaeli, mkabhi mwagheni na ngachemkabhi na pandu mu malaghilu gha chilanga yaka Chapanga kwa bhandu bhaki, mkatemi pundema mkabya mabhandu bhangakubha na lihobhalelu, wala ngachemwabhi na Chapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Nambu sajenu, kwa kulombana na Kristo Yesu, mwehapa ambabhu pamwandi hapa mkabhi kutali na Chapanga, sajenu mletakiki pambipi kwa indela ja mwahi waka Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Maghambu Kristo mweni atuletili lukwali kwa kubhatenda Bhayahude na bhandu bha mataifa ghangi kubha bhamu. Kwa hyegha jaki mweni akabhombwili lumatu lola lwa uadui lolukabhi lutulekanesha. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Akabhohiki Shelia ya Kiyahude papamu na amuli yaki na malaghalakilu ghaki, nahuli kubhokana na bhandu bhabheli habha abhombaje mundu jumu wahenu mu kulombana najombi na bhela kuleta lukwali. <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>Kwa hyegha jaka Kristo akauyoningi uadui wabhu, kwa kupotela kwaki punsalaba akabhalombanishi bhandu habha kubha chindu chimu na kubhajonganesha na Chapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Bhela, Kristo akahikiki na kutangaza Malobhi Manyahi gha lukwali kwinu mwehapa mabhandu bha mataifa ghangi mwemkabhi kutali na Chapanga, na kabhete kwa Bhayahude ambabhu bhakabhili pambipi na Chapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Kwa ndandi kwa kupetela kwaka Kristo, tepani tabhokapi, Bhayahude na bhandu bha mataifa ghangi, tuweza kunjendela Atati kwa indela jaka Roho jumu.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Bhela, mwehapa nga mwagheni kabhete, wala nga mwabhapeta indela, nambu mbi mwabhenehi papamu na bhahuhu, nde bhandu bha munyumba jaka Chapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Mchengakiki panani ja luhuli lolubhekakiki na mitumi na bhalota bhaka Chapanga, najombi Kristo Yesu mweni nde liganga likolongwa la kunkeghi la kukamulakila nyumba. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Kwa kulombana na Kristo lichengu lokapi likamulana papamu wichu na kukola mbaka kubha Nyumba jihuhu kwa ndandi jaka Bambo. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Kwa kulombana na Kristo, mwehapa nanamu mchengakeka papamu na kubha matamu ghaka Chapanga kwa indela jaka Roho waki.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Lihengu laka Paulo kwa bhandu bha inchi yengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Kwa ndandi jenjenu, nepani Paulo, nde mkongeka waka Kristo Yesu kwa ndandi jinu mwehapa mabhandu bha mataifa ghangi, <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>chakaka njomwili kujowana kubhokana na lihengu lela la chihomu chaka Chapanga cheambekihi kwa ndandi jinu. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Nepani akanimanyihi sili heyi kwa indela ja uyekuliku, ngati monalongulili kulemba lijambu leniheli kwa ujipi, <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>na mwehapa anamughasomiki malobhi ghangu anamuweza kumanya ntundu mommanyila kwa uchakaka sili heji jaka Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Pamwandi bhandu ngachebhakamanyiswi sili jeniheji, nambu sajenu Chapanga abhamanyihi mitumi na bhalota bhaki bhahuhu kwa indela jaka Roho. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Sili jeni nde kubha, kwa indela ja Malobhi Manyahi bhandu bha mataifa ghangi bhapata pandu pabhu papamu na Bhayahude mu mihupu jela jaka Chapanga, bhombi nde ihungu ya hyegha jelajela, na bhashiliki papamu na tepani Bhayahude mu chilanga yela yeakatendiki Chapanga kwa indela jaka Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Nepani ndendakiki kubha mtumika wa Malobhi Manyahi kwa chihomu cha kanjika cheambekihi Chapanga kwa makili ghaki makolongwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Nepani nunchoku kupeta bhandu bhokapi bhaka Chapanga, nambu ambekihi chihomu chaki, nahuli nabhatangazya bhandu bha mataifa ghangi Malobhi Manyahi panani ja wamaheli waka Kristo wangakupemeka, <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>na kubhamulakila bhandu bhokapi bhabhonaje ntundu mpangu waka Chapanga ghouhiyakiki mouhengakeka. Chapanga joabhombiki hindu yokapi akahiiki sili heyi kutumbula mileli, <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>nahuli kwa indela ja likanisa, mbulau jokapi jaka Chapanga jipata kumanyikana kwa bhatawala na bhabhabhi na lijiniku mu ndema wa roho. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Chapanga akatendiki lijambu heli kubhokana na lengu laki la mileli ambalu akalitendiki kwa indela jaka Kristo Yesu Bambo witu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Bhela, kwa kulombana na Kristo na kwa uhobhalelu witu kwaki, tepani tuweza kunjendela Chapanga kwa ukangamalu. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Bhela, nundobha ngamwiheketa mtima kwa ndandi ja mang'ahiku ghanaghapata kwa ndandi jinu, maghambu ghanihagha nde kwa ndandi ja ulumbalilu winu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Upalu waka Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Kwa ndandi jenu nunchikamila majuwa Atati waka Bambo witu Yesu Kristo, <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>jombi nde Atati wa chakaka kwa familia jokapi kunani kumahunde na pundema. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Nundobha Chapanga, ampekya ukangamalu kwa kunjeghela makili mkati jinu kwa indela jaka Roho waki kulengana na umaheli wa ulumbalilu waki, <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>nahuli Kristo apata kutama mumitima jinu kwa indela ja uhobhalelu. Nundobha jombi mpata kubha na mikegha na luhuli mu upalu, <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>nahuli mpata kumanya papamu na bhahuhu bhokapi ntundu upalu waka Kristo moubhelili kwa upana waki, na ulachu waki, na kimu chaki, na kunyoleka kwaki, <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>na kuumanya upalu waka Kristo ghoupeta umanyi wokapi, kwa ntundu moubhelili wamaheli nahuli mpata kuhikila utimilifu wokapi waka Chapanga.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Bhela alumbalikaje jombi joaweza kutenda mambu gha kukangacha kupeta ghokapi ghatulobha au ghatuholalela, kwa ntundu wa makili ghaghahenga lihengu mkati jitu, <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>kwaka Chapanga ubya ulumbalilu mu likanisa na muka Kristo Yesu kwa ibheleku yokapi, mileli na mileli! Amina.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Umoja mu hyegha jaka Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Bhela, nepani nemili nkongeka kwa ndandi ja kuntumaki Bambo, nundobha mtamaje kwa luhomu lwinu molupalakila mu ulohakeku winu ghondowakike. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Kwa kuliheleha na upole na kwa uhinakilu na kutolanela mabheti kwa mabheti kwa upalu. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Mkangamalaje kulenda umoja ghouletakiki na Roho kwa kulujengalela lukwali lolubhi pachilanda jinu. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Kubhi na hyegha jimu na Roho jumu, na lihobhalelu limu lemulohakike na Chapanga. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Kabheti kubhi na Bambo jumu, uhobhalelu ghumu, na ubatizo ghumu, <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>kubhi na Chapanga jumu ambaju nde Atati wa bhokapi, joabhi panani ja ghokapi, mu ghokapi, na mkati ja ghokapi.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Nambu kila jumu witu akapekiwi chihomu chaki kulengana na chipemu cha nhupu waki cheapekiwi na Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Ngati moghapwaghi Malembu Mahuhu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Paakagholwiki kunani kumahunde nakanopi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">akatoliki mateka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">na kubhapekeha bhandu nhupu.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Bhela, lilobhi heli palipwagha: “Akagholwiki kunani,” bho, ndandi jaki kike? Ndandi jaki nde kupwagha kubha kutumbula Kristo akahelili upambala wa pahi nakanopi wa pundema. <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Bhela jombi joakahulwiki hoju pani pundema nde joakagholwiki kunani nakanopi kupeta kunani kumahunde koha, nahuli apata kuutwelakela ndema wokapi. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Jombi nde joabhekiki bhandu bhangi kubha mitumi, bhangi kubha bhalota, bhangi bhabhatangaza Malobhi Manyahi, bhangi kubha bhadima na bhangi kubha bhabhola. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Akatendiki bhenibhela nahuli apata kubhakamilisha bhahuhu bhokapi kwa ndandi ja kutenda lihengu, nahuli kujichenga hyegha jaka Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Mbaka tabhokapi tuuhikilaje umoja wa uhobhalelu na kummanya nakanopi Mwana waka Chapanga, na kubha mundu mkamilifu, na kuhikila mu chipemu cha utimilifu waka Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Nahuli ngatwikubha kabhete bhana bhang'eng'a, tukalekalika koni na koni na kutolakeka na kila mpongu wa mabholu gha upuhi gha bhandu, kwa kuchenjela, kwa kuijengalela indela yabhu ya upuhi. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Nambu tupwaghanya chakaka kwa mtima wa upalu, mu kila lijambu na kukola hata kunhikila jombi joabhi mmutu, yani, Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Pahi ja ujemalelu waki, ihungu yokapi ya hyegha ilombini na kukamulana papamu na miheleti, na hyegha jokapi jijangatana kwa ujangatilu wa ihungu yaki. Bhela ngati kila chiungu chihenga lihengu laki ngati moipalakila, hyegha jokapi jikola na kulichenga mu upalu.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Matamu Ghahenu muka Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Bhela, kwa lihina laka Bambo, nundakalila: Ngamwijendalela kutama kwa luhomu ngati bhandu bhangakummanya Chapanga, ambabhu maholalelu ghabhu ngacheghabhi na ndandi jokapi. <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>Malangu gha bhandu bhanihabha ghajeghaliki lwihi, na bhabhi kutali na womi waka Chapanga kwa ndandi ja ung'ang'a ghoubhi mkati jabhu na ing'omu ya mitima jabhu. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Bhahobhiki na ngachebhabhi na ihoni, bhalijeghela mu mambu machafu, na kupala kutenda kila ntundu wa uhakau koni bhakajendalya kutokulela kubha na hindu yamaheli nakanopi.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Nambu mwehapa ngachemulibholiki bhenibhela panani jaka Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Nde chakaka kubha, mwehapa njowini wichu, kabhete mbolakiki naku, uchakaka ghola ghoubhi muka Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Bhela mululekaje luhomu lwinu lwa mwande, lolukabhi lumpeleka mu kuyonangeka kwa kujengalela utokulelu ghoukabhi unkolowa mwenga. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Nahuli mtendakikaje bhahenu mu roho na maholalelu ghinu. <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>Mkawataje utu wahenu, ghoubhombakiki kulengana na ulenganesu waka Chapanga na ambau ulilangiha mu matamu gha chakaka gha wambone na uhuhu.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Bhela muuleka upuhi! Kila mundu impalika kumpwaghi njaki uchakaka, maghambu kila jumu witu nde kiungu cha hyegha jaka njaki. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Mkubhaje na inyela, nambu ngamwitenda mahoku, na wala ngamwitama na mabhinilu mbaka lyobha kujibhila, <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>nahuli ngamwampekeha Shetani mbekenyu. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Joakabhi ajibha, ngaijibha kabhete, nambu atumbula kuhenga lihengu linyahi kwa mabhoku ghaki, apata kubha na chindu cha kunjangatila mundu joabhi kahochu. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Malobhi mahakau ngaghipita ng'o mumilomu jinu, nambu ghala ghaghajangatila kwa ndandi ja kubhachenga bhangi nahuli lapekya chihomu bhabhalijowana. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Ngamwanhuzunisha Roho Mhuhu waka Chapanga, ndandi Roho hoju nde muhuli waka Chapanga kwinu kubha mwehapa nde bhandu bhaki, na nde kulangiha kubha lichobha lihika ambapu Chapanga anaamkombulaje. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Mboha mangani mabhinilu, na kuhyoma na inyela na njobhela na matondu, na nkotukaje kila ntundu wa uhakau. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Mkubhaje na mtima wambone na ghoubhi na chiha, kila jumu na andekakya njaki mahoku ghaki ngati bhela Chapanga moandekakili mwenga mahoku ghinu kwa kupetela Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Kutama mu Unang'anu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Bhela munjighaje Chapanga, ngati bhana bhapalu. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Upalu ulonguhaje matamu ghinu ngati bhela Kristo moakatupalile, na kwa ndandi jitu akalibhohiki mweni ngati nyambiku ja kujochakeka jejibhoha unungilu unyahi na nyambiku jejunyambiha Chapanga.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Nambu ukemi ngawiloghuleka ng'o pachilanda jinu wala uhakau wa ntundu wokapi wala utokulelu, kwa ndandi mambu ghanihagha ngacheghapalika pachilanda ja bhahuhu. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Kabhete malobhi mahakau gha ihoni, gha ung'ang'a au ing'omu, ghokapi hagha ngacheghapalika kwinu, nambu malobhi gha kunchengula Chapanga nde ghaghapalika. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Kwa ndandi lilobhi lenu mulimanyi chakaka ja kubha njeta nkemi wala muhakau, wala joabhi na utokulelu uhakau, yani joajobhabhela imong'umong'u, joabhi na upwelelu mu Ukolongwa waka Kristo na waka Chapanga.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Ngamwijetakela kukoluheka na mundu kwa malobhi matopu, kwa kubha inyela jaka Chapanga jihika kwa ndandi ja mambu ngati ghanihagha panani ja bhandu bhala bhangakutii. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Bhela, ngamwilombana nabhu. <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Mwandi mwehapa mkabhi mu lwihi, nambu sajenu mwehapa mbi mu unang'anu kwa kulombana na Bambo. Mtamaje ngati bhana bha unang'anu, <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>kwa kubha litunda la unang'anu lipatikana mu wambone wokapi, kuhenga mambu ghaghunyambiha Chapanga na chakaka, <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>mwehapa mlondaje kumanya ghala ghaghunyambiha Bambo. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Ngamwihenga mambu gha lwihi ghangakupalika, nambu mubhalakalyaje bhabhahenga bhenibhela, <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>kwa ndandi nde ihoni hata kughaloghola mambu ghala ghabhahenga kwa kulihiya. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Nambu ghokapi ghaghamulakiwi na unang'anu, ghabhonikana, maghambu chokapi chekibhonakini nde unang'anu, <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>kwa kubha unang'anu nde ghoutenda kila chindu chibhonikanaje. Nde ndandi Malembu Mahuhu ghapwagha:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Jumukaje, wenga weughonile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">uhyokaje kuhuma mu bhakuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">najombi Kristo anaakumulakyaje.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Bhela ndingalyaje namaa ntundu montamila. Ngamwitama ngati bhandu bhang'ang'a, nambu ngati bhandu bhabhabhi na mbulau. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Mtumila wichu chikahi chembi nachu, maghambu machobha ghani nde gha uhakau. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Kwa ndandi jeniheji ngamwikubha mwang'ang'a, nambu mpata kumanya nde kike ghaghabhi mapalu ghaka Bambo.<verse eid="EPH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Mkotukaje kulobhela uwembi, maghambu monihomu kubhi na uhakau, nambu mtwelakikaje Roho Mhuhu: <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Mpwaghanyaje mabhene kwa mabhene kwa Zabuli, nyembu ya kulumbalila na nyembu ya kiroho, koni mkajembaje na kundumbalila Bambo mu mitima jinu. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Machobha ghokapi munchengula Chapanga Atati kwa kila lijambu mu Lihina laka Bambo witu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhwanu waki na Ndomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Kila jumu antopila njaki kwa ndandi ja utopelu ghombi naku kwaka Kristo.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Nanamu mwentoghuliki, mubhatopila bhalomi bhinu ngati kuntii Bambo witu. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Kwa ndandi ndomi nde mmutu waka nhwanu waki ngati bhela Kristo moabheli mmutu wa likanisa, ambalu nde hyegha jaki, najombi Kristo nde Mkengalela waki. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Ngati bhela likanisa molintii Kristo, bhelabhela na bhabhatoghuliki na bhombi ibhapalika kubhatii bhalomi bhabhu.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Mwehapa bhalomi, mubhapala bhahanu bhinu, ngati bhela Kristo moakalipalile likanisa na akalibhohiki kwa ndandi jaki. <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Akatendiki bhenibhela nahuli kulitenda likanisa kubha lihuhu kwaka Chapanga, baada ja kuling'alisha kwa kuligholola kwa machi mu Lilobhi laki, <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>nahuli apata kuliletela likanisa linyahi nakanopi, likanisa langakubha na lidoa wala ngwinyanila, wala uhakau wa ntundu wokapi ghola, nambu libya lihuhu langakubha na mahakau. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Bhelabhela ibhapalika bhalomi kubhapala akaahanu bhabhu ngati hyegha yabhu bhene. Mundu joampala nhwanu waki alipala mwene. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Njeta mundu joajihakalila hyegha jaki mwene, nambu ajileha na kujighoha wichu, ngati Kristo moalighohela likanisa laki, <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>kwa ndandi tepani nde ihungu ya hyegha jake. <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>“Kwa ndandi jeniheji, mwanalomi anaandeka atati waki na mabhu waki najombi anaalombana na nhwanu waki, na bhabheli habha anabhakubha hyegha jimu.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Sili heji nde ngolongwa nambu nepani nongela malobhi panani jaka Kristo na likanisa. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Hata bhela, ghanihagha ghumpalika mwehapa nanamu: Kila mwanalomi impalika ampalaje nhwanu waki ngati moalipalila mwene, najombi nhwanu waki impalika antopilaje ndomi waki.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s">Bhana na bhabheleka bhabhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Mwehapa mabhana, impalika kubhatii bhabheleka bhinu muka Bambo, maghambu leniheli nde lijambu lambone. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>“Watopila atati waku na mabhu bhaku,” jeniheji nde amuli ja kutumbula jeibhi na chilanga: <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>“Upata upengalelu na kutama machobha ghamaheli pundema.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Mwehapa akatati, ngamwatumbula bhana bhinu, nambu mwalelayi kwa utopelu na mabholu ghaka Bambo.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhatumwa na Mabambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Mwehapa mwatumwa, impalika kubhatii bhanihabha bhabhabhi mabambo bhinu kwa ntundu wa hyegha, kwa choghohi, na kubhaghaja, na kwa mtima wa kuhatambuka ngati bhela muntii Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Ntendaje bhenibhela nga pe chikahi pabhundingalila nahuli mpata upendeleu wabhu, nambu mubhahengilaje ngati bhatumwa bhaka Kristo, mkahenga mapalu ghaka Chapanga kwa mtima. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Mhengaje kwa mtima wokapi, ngati bhela muntumaki Bambo, na nga ngati muntumaki mundu. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Mkombukaje kubha kila mundu joatenda mambu ghambone, akubhi mtumika au mundu wa kulijeka, anaajopalya nhupu waki kuhuma kwaka Bambo.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Mwehapa mabambo, mubhahengilaje bhatumika bhinu ntundu bhelabhela. Nkotuka kubhajoghoha, mkombukaje kubha mwehapa nanamu ngati bhela bhombi, mbi na Bambo jolajola kunani kumahunde, najombi ngacheabhi na upendeleu.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Silaha yokapi yaka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Ujomukelu, mpetalyaje kubha na ukangamalu mu kulombana na Bambo na kwa ujangatilu wa makili ghaki makolongwa. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Muwata silaha yokapi yaka Chapanga nahuli mpata kuupenga uchenjelu wokapi waka Shetani. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Maghambu ngondo yitu nga panani ja inyama na mwahi, nambu ngondo yitu nde tukomana na manjolinjoli mahakau gha ndema wa kiroho, tukomana na bhabhabhi na lujiniku, bhatawala bhabhabhi na makili, bhabhakamulakila ndema ghoni wa lwihi. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Kwa ndandi jeniheji, muwata silaha yokapi yaka Chapanga nahuli muweza kunhibhalakila adui mu lichobha lela la uhakau palihikaje, na ananjomwili kutenda ghokapi, njemaje kwa ukangamalu.<verse eid="EPH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Bhela njema tayale, koni mlikongiki chakaka ngati ulamba muibhunu hinu, na kutenda mambu ghaghunyambiha Chapanga ghunhibhalya ngati chikopa pachihimba, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>na chilolu cha kutangaza Malobhi Manyahi gha lukwali chibya ngati magubasi mu magholu ghinu. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Nakanopi ja ghanihagha ghokapi, mtolaje chikopa cha uhobhalelu ambachu kwa chenihechi anamuweza kujichuchua mikoha jokapi jejibhi na moto jaka Muhakau jola. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Njopalyaje ukengaleku ngati kofia ja choma, na Lilobhi laka Chapanga ngati lipanga lempekewa na Roho Mhuhu. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Mlobhaje chikahi chokapi, koni mkalobha ujangatilu waka Chapanga. Mlobhaje kila chikahi kwa makili ghaka Roho. Mtama mihu panga kutonda mkalobha kwa ndandi ja bhahuhu bhokapi. <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Mnobhilaje na nepani kabhete, nahuli kila pamopola ndomu wangu, Chapanga ambekyaje malobhi gha kupwagha, nahuli nhweza kutangaza sili ja Malobhi Manyahi kwa ukangamalu. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Nepani nde wakili kwa ndandi ja Malobhi Manyahi hata ngati sajenu mi muchifungu. Bhela, mlobhaji nahuli mbataje kughatangaza kwa ukangamalu ngati moimbalakila.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulamukilu wa kujomulela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Tikiko, ndongu witu mpalu na mtumika ndongwana mu kulombana na Bambo, anaampwaghila malobhi ghangu ghokapi, nahuli mpata kumanya chenhenga. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Nuntuma kwinu kwa ndandi jeniheji, nahuli ampataje kughamanya mambu ghitu, najombi anaanjeghala mtima.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Lukwali lubyaje kwa bhalongu bhahobhalela, na upalu papamu na uhobhalelu kuhuma kwaka Chapanga Atati na Bambo Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Chihomu chibyaje na bhokapi bhabhumpala Bambo witu Yesu Kristo kwa upalu wanga na ujomukelu. Amina.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
